{"data":{"body":"[P2] Handle deletion-start failures per stack\n\nIf any `delete-stack` invocation fails, `execFileSync` throws outside a catch, aborting the sweep before subsequent stacks are processed or existing deletions are awaited. One persistently failing stack can therefore block cleanup of unrelated closed PRs on later sweeps too. Collect deletion-start failures per stack, continue processing the others, then wait for successfully started deletions and report aggregate failures.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABD657Ng","finding_digest":"a0a92b2446540dda447a2b538e08503aa1c5d3f857e701c291535dda44439054","finding_id":"arf_v1_ucuswjcgkqg5urd2fnjy4ccqhk","finding_key":"integration-test/cleanup-pr-stacks.mjs::delete-stack-loop::one-failure-aborts-sweep","identity_key":"integration-test/cleanup-pr-stacks.mjs::delete-stack-loop::one-failure-aborts-sweep","line":129,"observation_digest":"65dfddba37b427367e4b7ae2e42439a31b975b612b30a5cd2140de41fab3e295","observation_id":"aro_v1_mxp53orxwqttm7slplroijbzum","path":".github/workflows/scripts/integration-test/cleanup-pr-stacks.mjs","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ucuswjcgkqg5urd2fnjy4ccqhk","published_at":"2026-11-13T00:08:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5oggezzeww7hgpuhlt2svak4pv","reviewed_base_sha":"48173acd2de943ce5fb43de8dd3683b9bcf8ab50","reviewed_head_sha":"7e0a678f651c91f285ac6fb9a7e00504bd92c13d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":127,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1222},"record_id":"art_v1_fj7udn733nx6sz2h3oxxxmwbyk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-13T00:08:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
